  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender Equality/Gender Based Violence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gender Equality/Gender Based Violence initiative supported key Government of Papua New Guinea (GoPNG) agencies including the Department for Community Development and Religion, development partners and other stakeholders to advance gender equality in PNG and work to eliminate gender-based violence.  The funding supported GoPNG and civil society led activities aimed at influencing PNG Government policy activities, developing gender networks and enhancing skills of men and women in PNG to influence change.</narrative>
  </description>
